<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Scaling microfinance requires balancing borrower volume with operational complexity. A larger borrower base enhances revenue potential but also increases repayment risk unless supported by efficient systems. Lessons from Bandhan Bank illustrate that rapid scale without adequate support structures leads to repayment stress, whereas models that combine trusted agents with digital tools represent the most sustainable growth pathway for WMI.)
/Pg 14 0 R
>>
endobj
