164 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (Examples across the industry highlight the trade-offs between growth, trust, and sustainability. Grameen Bank demonstrates the enduring strength of community trust but faces challenges in scaling without losing social orientation. Bandhan Bank shows how MFIs can scale into full banking institutions but at the cost of operational strain.)
/Pg 14 0 R
>>
endobj
